# expect: 3
# expect: 10
# expect: 40
# expect: [arr 10 20 30 40]
# M4d: flat [Arr i64] — 8-byte raw element storage; integer literals
# flex to i64. arr-get/arr-pop return the element as an UNBOXED WIDE i64
# (narrowed, not dyn — see arr_typed_i64_narrow.jacl); print bridges via
# ensure_boxed, so the rendered values here are unchanged.
def a [[Arr i64] 10 20 30]
print [arr-len $a]
print [arr-get $a 0]
arr-push $a 40
print [arr-get $a 3]
print $a
